  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "敵の目を　あざむく　フード付き　マント。持たせると　体を　包み隠し技の　追加効果を　受けなくなる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "상대의 눈을 속이는 후드 달린 망토. 지니게 하면 몸을 숨겨서 기술의 추가 효과를 받지 않게 된다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "能瞞過敵人視線的連帽斗篷。攜帶後，自己的身體會被包覆並隱藏，而不受到招式的追加效果影響。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Objet à tenir. Une cape à capuchon qui dissimule le porteur aux yeux de ses adversaires et le protège des effets additionnels des capacités.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Item zum Tragen. Dieser Kapuzenumhang verbirgt den Träger trickreich vor den Augen seiner Angreifer und schützt ihn so vor Zusatzeffekten ihrer Attacken.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Capa con capucha que engaña al rival. Oculta a quien la lleve y lo protege de los efectos secundarios de los movimientos de sus rivales.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Strumento da dare a un Pokémon. Manto con cappuccio che nasconde chi lo indossa, proteggendolo dagli effetti aggiuntivi delle mosse subite.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. This hooded cloak conceals the holder, tricking the eyes of its enemies and protecting it from the additional effects of moves.",
